XI JINPING COMMENTS ON TALKS WITH TRUMP

China and the United States can work together to achieve more meaningful goals for the benefit of the world.;

The two great powers will work together at all levels and through all channels to improve mutual understanding.;

China will host the APEC summit in 2026, and the United States will host the G20 summit; the parties should support each other and strive for positive outcomes at both summits.;

Economic and trade ties should remain the driving force of relations between China and the United States, and not become an obstacle.;

China and the United States should cooperate adequately on international and regional issues.

