China and the United States can work together to achieve the best for both countries, Xi Jinping said at a meeting with Trump. Other statements by the Chinese leader:

Chinese and American negotiators generally reached agreement on the main issues of bilateral relations and made "encouraging progress" in the dialogue.;

Reaching consensus at the recent trade talks between China and the United States provided the necessary conditions for a meeting of the leaders;

China and the United States can share responsibility in a world that faces many challenges.;

Trump has made a "great contribution" to the cease-fire in Gaza.

